SUMMARY:Captivating Swaras
LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$20 admission / $10 students & seniors / 5pm doors / seated & s
 tanding Captivating Swaras returns to the Lilypad this Saturday! This time
  we have a very special interactive performance from harmonium master Keda
 r Naphade\, accompanied by Pranav Ghatraju on tabla. come to hear his wond
 erful playing as well as for an interactive audience-inclusive session whe
 re you can learn about this wonderful instrument\, how it’s played\, ask
  questions\, and learn! this amazing event should not be missed by anyone 
 interested in harmonium and indian instruments.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.
 com/home/2026/captivating-swaras-2\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.c
 ity/boston/
URL:https://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026/captivating-swaras-2
END:VEVENT
