 ment--tertiary sqs-block-button-element" data-sqsp-button > Get Tickets Jo
 hn Lebanon plays an original\, improvisational set blending the melodic wa
 rmth of the Levant with the grit of Northeast alternative rock. Drawing fr
 om a decade of movement from Beirut to Boston\, the music explores navigat
 ing two cultures and the search for a sense of place. The set features son
 gs from Kite Without a String\, released in June 2026\, alongside other or
 iginal material.\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026/10/11/john-lebano
 n\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
